      "canonical_latex": "\\Delta K := K_{\\max} - K_{\\min} = Y \\Delta\\sigma \\sqrt{\\pi a},\\quad \\Delta\\sigma = \\sigma_{\\max} - \\sigma_{\\min},\\quad R = \\frac{K_{\\min}}{K_{\\max}}",
